    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for Airtop, a cloud-browser platform for AI agents. Create and manage remote Chromium browser sessions, open and navigate windows, drive pages with natural-language interactions (click, type, hover, scroll), query and extract page content with AI, capture screenshots, and persist state with profiles. All requests are authenticated with a Bearer API key.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Airtop Support",
